      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "All B requests processed together \u2014 no per-request Python loop.  3D boxes = batched tensors.  L-layout: A (left) \u00d7 B (top) = C.",
